{"id":"vod_md_3691","vodId":"3691","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"超自然9人组","name_cn":"超自然9人组","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230830-1/1d7cf1db13e1e83d30a7882892715624.jpg"},"summary":"我闻悠太（梶裕贵 配音）是一位胸怀大志的高中二年级学生，他的理想就是一夜暴富。为了实现自己的梦想，悠太一直经营着一个名为“轻轻松松破假象”的人气博客，致力于用科学的方式来解释一切超自然灵异现象。这个博客的存在令一波古怪而又狂热的角色们走到了一起。天真浪漫，能够和人迅速拉近距离的灵媒成泽棱歌（佐仓绫音 配音）、在网络上有着极高人气的占卜师相川实优羽（吉田仁美 配音）、冷若冰霜的黑魔术代行红之亚里亚（泽城美雪 配音）、能够预知未来的工口漫画家西园梨梨花（能登麻美子 配音），在这些怪人的围绕之下，悠太还能够理直气壮的表示，超自然现象并不存在吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-08-30 08:22:29","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/iymksuZ1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/obukBTEF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/bxZboiF4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/AYWI9CrA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/QNCQutRv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/lJInaEuZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/FZSLFO0e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/nio1k2VL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/ACfUQvhc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/ZyMCH8CK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/egkrKFJC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230827/i76lEfiw/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:54.333Z"}